### Uber Eats AI Search - API Testing
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8001/api

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Initialize Menu Database
POST {{baseUrl}}/recipes/upload

### Get All Recipes
GET {{baseUrl}}/recipes

### Search: High Protein Low Carb
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "high protein low carb dinner",
    "filters": {}
}

### Search: Spicy Vegetarian
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "spicy vegetarian meal",
    "filters": {}
}

### Search: Under 400 Calories
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "healthy meal under 400 calories",
    "filters": {}
}

### Search: Indian Food
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "indian curry",
    "filters": {}
}

### Search: Quick Comfort Food
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "comfort food quick delivery",
    "filters": {}
}
